{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "heat_1d_zero_grad_nonunit",
    "description": "MMS driver on a NON-UNIT, NON-ORIGIN domain — the end-to-end proof that grids/cartesian_uniform_1d serves arbitrary consumer-specified extents with no library-file edits: 1-D heat equation u_t = alpha u_xx on x in [-1.5, 2.5] (a = -1.5, b = 2.5, L = b - a = 4; deliberately non-integral endpoints) with zero-gradient (homogeneous Neumann) boundaries, discretized by grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/rules/central_D2_zero_grad_bc — the SAME rule file the unit-interval problem uses, unchanged. Manufactured solution u(x,t) = exp(-alpha (pi/L)^2 t) cos(pi (x - a)/L) with alpha = 0.2. Derivation: u_xx = -(pi/L)^2 u and u_t = -alpha (pi/L)^2 u, so u_t = alpha u_xx exactly (no forcing term); u_x = -(pi/L) exp(-alpha (pi/L)^2 t) sin(pi (x - a)/L) vanishes at x = a (sin 0 = 0) and at x = b (sin pi = 0), matching the zero-gradient rule. The grid's consumer-supplied geometry contract (grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/grid.esm) is fulfilled for [a, b]: x0 = -1.5 (parameter) and dx = (b - a)/N = 4/N (an observed whose expression divides by the metaparameter name N, substituted at load per esm-spec 9.7.6, so the convergence sweep's loader-API rebinding of N keeps dx consistent) resolve the rule body's free dx at evaluation — the stencil's 1/dx^2 face and interior coefficients pick up the physical spacing 4/N purely through consumer-defined variables. Initial condition and test references spell the grid's index-to-coordinate conversion x_i = x0 + (i - 1/2) dx = -1.5 + (i - 1/2)(4/N) inline with load-foldable scalars instead of applying the free-name x_coord template: the official 6.6.5/ic build-time cellwise evaluation is scope-free (model parameters/observeds are not in scope there), so build-time coordinate expressions must fold from literals and metaparameters alone. All sweep resolutions are powers of two, so every x_i is a dyadic rational and the (x_i - a) cancellation in the references is exact in double precision.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:cartesian_uniform_1d",
      "equation:heat",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "HeatNonunit": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/rules/central_D2_zero_grad_bc.esm"
        }
      ],
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": [
            "x"
          ],
          "description": "Temperature field over the x index set."
        },
        "alpha": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m^2/s",
          "default": 0.2,
          "description": "Thermal diffusivity."
        },
        "x0": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": -1.5,
          "description": "Left domain edge a = -1.5: the grid's x0 free name (consumer-supplied geometry contract, grids/cartesian_uniform_1d/grid.esm)."
        },
        "dx": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "description": "Grid spacing (b - a)/N = 4/N for the domain [-1.5, 2.5]: the grid's dx free name, resolved inside the rewrite rule's expanded body at evaluation. N is the document-scoped metaparameter (re-exported up the import chain), substituted as an integer literal at load (esm-spec 9.7.6), so loader-API rebinding for the convergence sweep keeps dx consistent."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "ic",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ]
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "cos",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  0.7853981633974483,
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "aggregate",
                        "output_idx": [
                          "i"
                        ],
                        "args": [],
                        "ranges": {
                          "i": {
                            "from": "x"
                          }
                        },
                        "expr": {
                          "op": "+",
                          "args": [
                            -1.5,
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "-",
                                  "args": [
                                    "i",
                                    0.5
                                  ]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "/",
                                  "args": [
                                    4,
                                    "N"
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      -1.5
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "u"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              "alpha",
              {
                "op": "D",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "D",
                    "args": [
                      "u"
                    ],
                    "wrt": "x"
                  }
                ],
                "wrt": "x"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dx",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
              4,
              "N"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_neumann_decay_nonunit",
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(x,t) = exp(-alpha (pi/L)^2 t) cos(pi (x - a)/L) on [a, b] = [-1.5, 2.5], L = 4, alpha = 0.2. Derivation: u_xx = -(pi/L)^2 u and u_t = -alpha (pi/L)^2 u, so u_t = alpha u_xx exactly; u_x proportional to sin(pi (x - a)/L) vanishes at both x = a and x = b, matching the zero-gradient rule; no forcing term. Constants: pi/L = 0.7853981633974483, (pi/L)^2 = 0.6168502750680849. References evaluate at the cell centers x_i = x0 + (i - 1/2) dx = -1.5 + (i - 1/2)(4/N), spelled inline per esm-spec 6.6.5 (1-based index space; build-time evaluation folds literals and metaparameters only). The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring (reference equals the initial field); the t=0.1 assertion bounds the relative L2 discretization error, whose leading term t alpha (pi/L)^2 (pi/N)^2 / 12 is approximately 4e-5 at N=16, 1e-5 at N=32, 2.5e-6 at N=64, and 6e-7 at N=128 — O(dx^2), inside the 1e-4 bound at every resolution of the convergence sweep. Exact per-resolution error values are pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_1d_zero_grad_nonunit/golden/errors.json.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.1
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 1e-09
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "cos",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      0.7853981633974483,
                      {
                        "op": "-",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "aggregate",
                            "output_idx": [
                              "i"
                            ],
                            "args": [],
                            "ranges": {
                              "i": {
                                "from": "x"
                              }
                            },
                            "expr": {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                -1.5,
                                {
                                  "op": "*",
                                  "args": [
                                    {
                                      "op": "-",
                                      "args": [
                                        "i",
                                        0.5
                                      ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "op": "/",
                                      "args": [
                                        4,
                                        "N"
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          },
                          -1.5
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.1,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": {
                "abs": 0.0001
              },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "exp",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          -0.2,
                          0.6168502750680849,
                          0.1
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "cos",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          0.7853981633974483,
                          {
                            "op": "-",
                            "args": [
                              {
                                "op": "aggregate",
                                "output_idx": [
                                  "i"
                                ],
                                "args": [],
                                "ranges": {
                                  "i": {
                                    "from": "x"
                                  }
                                },
                                "expr": {
                                  "op": "+",
                                  "args": [
                                    -1.5,
                                    {
                                      "op": "*",
                                      "args": [
                                        {
                                          "op": "-",
                                          "args": [
                                            "i",
                                            0.5
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                          "op": "/",
                                          "args": [
                                            4,
                                            "N"
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              },
                              -1.5
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
